An enum for testing

This is like [`crate::GenericEnum`] but without the generic


```rust
enum TestEnum {
    /// Variant A (see also [`crate::GenericEnum`])
    VariantA,
    /// Variant B with data
    VariantB(String),
    /// Variant C with struct data (`name` and `value`)
    VariantC {
        name: String,
        value: i32,
    },
}
```

